      "sc:description": "HelixSide is an open-source Python package that quantifies geometrical orientation metrics (tilt, kink, and side angles) of protein helical secondary structures at single-residue and whole-protein levels, applicable to experimental structures, theoretical models, and molecular dynamics trajectories of membrane and soluble proteins.",
